	)
	(text "Decoupling capacitors for V3V3 rail:\nC29-C48: 100nF ceramic (0402) placed near IC power pins.\nBulk capacitors: 10uF and 22uF for rail stability.\nR32-R34: pull-up/pull-down resistors for signal integrity."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 281 0)
		(effects
